id: pm-rl-review107cubic
title: Triage the new Cubic review batch separately from PR 107 coverage
description: "This round triages the 27 original Cubic threads on PR 107. The earlier 23 fixes and 3 invalid-finding reproductions are retained. Published SDK 2026.11.2 now closes the remaining P1 original mkdir reproduction, with typed refusal mapping and regressions on this branch. A later-open substitution still creates an empty outside lock before refusing; pm-rl-confined-sdk-locks retains that broader acceptance blocker. Earlier and current focused validation evidence is in append-only comments. Full verification of the new head remains CI-only."
type: Task
